/**
 * Free Minecraft servers — one per verified account, running as a Docker
 * container on the dedicated "freemc-host" VM behind itzg/mc-router (hostname
 * -based routing + auto-scale up/down on connect/idle — see FreeMinecraftServer
 * in prisma/schema.prisma for the full architecture note).
 *
 * KNOWN GAP: disk usage is NOT hard-quota-enforced yet (Docker's storage-opt
 * quota needs XFS+pquota, which this host's filesystem doesn't have). The RAM
 * cap (Docker --memory, a real hard ceiling) and the total-server-count cap are
 * the enforced safety controls for now; `free_minecraft_disk_mb` exists for a
